printing.color_note = Ma pixel amasinthidwa kukhala sRGB. Pulogalamu yanu yoonera PDF ndi chosindikizira zimayangʼanira mbiri ya mitundu ya chosindikizira.
printing.sizing_note = Njira yokwaniritsa imayika chithunzi mkati mwa bokosi lililonse, kusunga chiŵerengero cha mbali zake popanda kudula. Kukula kwenikweni kumagwiritsa ntchito DPI ya chikalata; chepetsani mizere kapena mizati ya gulidi ngati sichikwanira. Sindikizani PDF pa 100% osagwiritsa ntchito njira yokwaniritsa tsamba.
printing.running = Kukonzekera PDF…
printing.save_pdf = Sungani PDF…
printing.open_print = Sungani ndi kutsegula PDF kuti musindikize…
printing.invalid = Zokonda zosindikizira kapena miyeso ya chithunzi si yolondola.
printing.limit = Ntchito yosindikiza yapitirira malire: zithunzi 200, ma pixel 40 miliyoni kapena ma pixel 32768 mbali iliyonse ya chithunzi chilichonse, kapena 256 MiB ya deta ya PDF yopanikizidwa.
printing.profile_error = Mbiri ya mitundu ya chithunzichi ndi yosavomerezeka, yosagwirizana kapena yosathandizidwa. Ma channel enieni a CMYK/Lab a chikalata amafuna mbiri yolondola yoikidwa mkati; RGB imafuna mbiri ya RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Chithunzichi sichikwanira mʼbokosi lino pa DPI ya chikalata chake. Gwiritsani ntchito njira yokwaniritsa, chepetsani mizere kapena mizati ya gulidi, kapena gwiritsani ntchito pepala lalikulu.
printing.caption_limit = Mawu ofotokozera chithunzi ndi aatali kwambiri pa gulidi iyi. Chepetsani mizere kapena mizati, fupikitsani mawuwo, kapena zimitsani mawu ofotokozera.
printing.font_error = Palibe font ya mawu ofotokozera chithunzi. Ikani font ya mawu kapena zimitsani mawu ofotokozera.
printing.no_document = Tsegulani chikalata kapena sankhani zithunzi za kamera mu gallery musanasindikize.
printing.source_error = Sitinathe kuwerenga chithunzi cha kamera chosankhidwa, fayilo yothandizira yokhala ndi zosintha, kapena mawu ofotokozera. Palibe PDF yomwe yasungidwa.
printing.save_error = Sitinathe kusunga PDF. Sankhani dzina latsopano la fayilo mufoda yomwe mungathe kulembamo; mafayilo omwe alipo sasinthidwa konse.
printing.downloaded = PDF yatsitsidwa. Tsegulani mu pulogalamu yoonera PDF kuti musindikize pa 100%.
